<title>UK: Ldn gold fixed inch lower, shrugs off U.S. payroll.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold fixed inch lower, shrugs off U.S. payroll.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed barely changed at $339.65 from $339.80. Shrugs off modest rise in April U.S. payrolls. Quoted $339.60/$340.10. Comex June futures slightly down.</p>
<p>SILVER - Reverses after steady morning. Down four cents at $4.71/$4.73. Critical support seen at $4.60.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off 80 cents at $371.70/$372.70.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Strengthens. Up 50 cents at $157.00/$158.00.</p>
</text>
